  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCING SMART AGRICULTURAL PRACTICES, TRACEABILITY, FOR VALUE ADDITION AND SUSTAINABLE MARKET ACCESS FOR SMALL HOLDER SPECIALTY ARABICA COFFEE FARMERS IN KABAROLE, BUNYANGABU AND NTOROKO DISTRICTS IN RWENZORI MOUNTAIN RANGES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the living income and improve the standard of living of 2,500 small holder coffee farmers in the Rwenzori Sub-Region through enhanced farmer participation and environmentally sustainable farming practices.</narrative>
  </description>
